      "summary_sent_score": 0.36136454343795776
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "2. It is stated that the Petitioner's application dated 18th November, 2025 remains undecided,\nprompting the present petition.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 699,
      "end": 825,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18th November, 2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 755,
          "end": 774
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. Mr. Sanjay Lao, Standing Counsel for the State, on instructions, submits that the application was received only on 01st December, 2025 and assures that a decision shall be taken within one week from today.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 827,
      "end": 1035,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sanjay Lao",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 834,
          "end": 844
        },
        {
          "text": "01st December, 2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 945,
          "end": 964
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "4. In view of the above, and without entering into the merits of the matter, the petition is disposed of in terms of the statement made on behalf of the State.",
